<title>课间说川话成违纪，学生：难道犯了天条？中媒：禁令本身就错据港媒报道，四川宜宾一学生投诉，课间说四川话被老师拍照取证、定性</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10575</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10575</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:29:04 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>课间说川话成违纪，学生：难道犯了天条？中媒：禁令本身就错</b><br/><br/>据港媒报道，四川宜宾一学生投诉，课间说四川话被老师拍照取证、定性违纪，须写500字检讨。学生质疑：“四川人说四川话，难道犯了天条？”<br/><br/>当地教体局20日答复称，法规未禁止课间说方言，责令废止相关规定。25日再称校方执行“机械化、简单化”，对涉事教师通报批评、诫勉谈话。<br/><br/>据自由亚洲电台报道，2021年宜宾亦有一年级女孩因说不好普通话崩溃大哭，视频引发争议；同年四川要求公务场合须用普通话。<br/><br/>光明网评论员引亲历者称，90年代中后期已有中小学“推普员”执行“课间不说普通话就扣分”；教育部2020年已称推普与传承方言“并不矛盾”，但学校却仍以拍照、写检查执行禁令，并质疑校规“存量清理”能否靠逐条上热搜推动。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2">#教育</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80">#语言</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D">#四川</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《香港01》<a href="https://global.hk01.com/article/60415123" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">四川学生小息讲四川话被当违纪 怒轰如犯天条 教育局责令废止</a><br/>《澎湃新闻》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34559696" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">学生课间说四川话被认定违纪，官方回应</a><br/>《自由亚洲电台》<a href="https://www.rfa.org/mandarin/yataibaodao/kejiaowen/sc-10292021141341.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">四川女孩因说不好普通话崩溃大哭 相关视频引发争议</a>（2021-10-29）<br/>《光明网》<a href="https://guancha.gmw.cn/2026-11/26/content_39124168.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">光明网评论员：“课间禁方言”，过时校规该退出</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/v8EouWIRcM4LbRfel6cO37TMAtaeSHyi4YMqY1qTQ8wddu0Ztn2DhxtOK16r6bItkmZC859nn5FrxP4hVuGgBdn2qnVTmDiRLGRBIWLp9tasPTHTd0uBm-PAppik4OCpqFv23LqklBW0SGG55Z0hZOwrp-aIgO6C2Ay9zkPWyxwQYE3YsX42dGNu53SB1MLmUi1IOnZVCXvtPySuc_SN3U63LLJZbEuvqeu4XAEdFjcAcHbWGIyCjqM1vxRAhwHQw5usim-r66u5qGcDrKlEGyV-1Iz06Ckv-pKRtEtuoV2ctad6HlYUvMpdL2GrLQ-G_c_FzabfBEpY3WbpQYBoxg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/et6mUBSbHrP_NWNAuM4U91uCfa30PwXPsdNc6CGr_wSPfsWxKxoTsonBxzIf4tjG9Bs23eEUF2i21Y2S6bTU9mMJ3PSJVWGQ3Irs2SRbXRXXTR5XyyHh9a-Pm2dAQJaHBzX-0YjrertuyeIsyBvULtm68Kk_R4XKWiSW9GE02R4YJhb1HPaGzlF2a6O5YHfcNihwKVcWR43TMCpfQk3BuuW2q4WqGLiYsd1qaQ3_bCxJHwNOVkhShT_7d27LKJYcEYkgTfNmInzkAng_8h1up_6EhI8B0Arr7Fgpfo1vbQrudG-jIW4iqr1PnrUAQVR5e_vOYeUIsL90ylW48GNF_A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/UC12nhlru-J8P2z4uAQoj0X0ucEgspUZ9ym6FrhN1IBKHahWlrfL1eY6PDXi5dAoL70U1Jn6crg7eEAijatXdfx7uPdt-oycbrJOceBilumcX0yZA7dfOMuL33X_qTOSrAmzKs7CKaqCvVuDoC7IFGMQpf8K0eJzUC2yKfMXPjfNn9oOGyif4wuhLkEgPiZmmIp-A0Mk-6V22QMsC-Pk2lYHFBaHBO7nGFGPoRczi7ADovrT5dB2AN1jA-xqthsPUOK7Kq1y_sgyTiU9CZJr0OBcqGOi_CrGaIT5rn4JKI390FtOHctV3XSUxNSNg9Dj1kZh28pxI98f5FVQunn2VQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/wBUMM08YZ-Py9CG1c7y7vpF-_SCgZiiD9Vaby7ifjOqdB1P5I94uYWhnjYRa0kEmk4yubylCypyN1z9jRh59nN8ceV81Is46CUziK6MVo2-icjMT1rhTdvVHQQ6hELI0tjtcfLEL0UuGQ5HIR9hRMwsjNHCYlIRT_U4MDaMp8KHjIW1mZP0EuUY-cEZdoxKLymfxKGSsIQNXZSwPfeA_SwEG_c8aaftX1RwAomWrJloeLimExJ1f28MmfvyW4hHm4GPS8zHpJd9cF49Ul04cp4-p0TRGy1TbCMTctXqo5B7GuZUGFzuELh0F-lfijAWMxtftkAa_hDPJMkmaUXPqNg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4AE.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4AC.png" referrerp